{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16438","headline":"金井歌 · 刘商","name":"金井歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文明化洽天地清，和气氤氲孕至灵。\n瑞雪不散抱层岭，阳谷霞光射山顶。\n薙草披沙石窦开，生金曜日明金井。\n虞衡相贺爲祯祥，畏人采攫持殳戕。\n羊驰马走尘满道，郡邸封章开建章。\n君王俭德先简易，赡国肥家在仁义。\n山泽藏金与万人，宣言郡邑无专利。\n闾阎少长竞奔凑，黄金满袖家富有。\n驩心蹈舞歌皇风，愿载讴歌青史中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}